    "working_thesis": "Hannah Arendt analyzes the fundamental human activities of labor, work, and action within the vita activa, tracing how the historical eclipse of durable 'work' and political 'action' by the glorification of 'labor' and the life process has resulted in a modern society of laborers and consumers dominated by necessity."
